{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"be9df24611c6398984a613a82aa6d4d476d2f6da16fdce90e6cfbc6ab6538075","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_14be4290562c941c92327b1c231f5d7a5d1de79ff8ef53469d729ff84926ecdd","overall_assessment":"The paper presents a technical contribution to scalable memory networks but fails to adhere to double-blind anonymity policies by revealing author identities and affiliations. Additionally, it lacks explicit discussions on data licensing compliance and broader societal impact, which are standard expectations for policy and compliance reviews.","paper_id":"BJ0Ee8cxx","paper_identity_sha256":"b235f8ab07da3b74ec85bc52230e2b9aeb05dd39928238d4ce02e47baff6641f","prompt_identity_sha256":"3e1f836f132d363d856f79bd12f68f18f714ae1535c59cadc40f79dd3c4a251f","raw_response_sha256":"af6293b645a73c5b26bb81f46235afb2b74aca755c0ae59394c167a85110f694","request_identity_sha256":"efce9562c75274ce8f0ba5a6c03088442b900aa38239b16b2647b32fe9ad57dd","reviewer_identity_sha256":"6832030d37bc6b05f4de12f913ecdea182594ad5d7ac3dcd33edcb54d7bd3a1a","role":"POL","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v2","structural_context_sha256":"ec8cc86da9d81ce8a38b5be410cca5062f602d489d08646f9fd3ed8657b0909d","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper does not include a dedicated section on ethics, fairness, or potential societal harms. While the application (factoid question answering) is relatively low-risk, the lack of discussion on bias in the underlying knowledge base (Freebase) or the potential for the model to propagate factual errors is a minor gap. However, given the technical nature of the contribution (scalability of memory access), the absence of extensive ethical mitigation strategies is not a critical flaw, though a brief statement on responsible use would be beneficial.","subdimension_id":"POL-ETH"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-025","SRC-026"],"review_text":"The paper utilizes the SimpleQuestions dataset, which is derived from Freebase. The authors cite Bordes et al. (2015) for the dataset source. There is no explicit mention of data licensing terms, consent for the use of Freebase data, or privacy compliance, although Freebase is a public knowledge base. The use of TransE embeddings (Bordes et al., 2013) is also cited. While standard for the era and domain, explicit confirmation of adherence to data usage policies or licensing would strengthen the compliance profile.","subdimension_id":"POL-DAT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-001"],"review_text":"The paper explicitly lists the authors' names and their institutional affiliations (Université de Montréal, Twitter, IBM Watson Research Center, CIFAR) on the title page. This violates the double-blind review policy typically enforced at venues like ICLR, as it reveals the identities of the authors and their affiliations to the reviewers.","subdimension_id":"POL-ANO"},{"paper_anchor_ids":[],"review_text":"The paper cites relevant prior work extensively, including Memory Networks, Neural Turing Machines, and various MIPS techniques. There is no evidence of plagiarism or dual submission within the visible text. The content appears original, with proper attribution to foundational works in the field.","subdimension_id":"POL-PLG"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-035"],"review_text":"The paper does not include a broader impact statement or a checklist for societal considerations, which are increasingly expected in modern ML submissions. The conclusion focuses on technical future work (dynamic K-MIPS) rather than societal implications. While the technical contribution is clear, the absence of a broader impact discussion is a limitation in terms of current compliance standards for responsible AI reporting.","subdimension_id":"POL-IMP"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"13008a728a31120adbe83c9f0f4bdb19949f4ad3bef0c26f3e34afa617c65e68","paper_id":"BJ0Ee8cxx","paper_ordinal":18,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"af6293b645a73c5b26bb81f46235afb2b74aca755c0ae59394c167a85110f694","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"BJ0Ee8cxx","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"f8dc3324e52be51fc5d03fb5d7d7352105118800bd177412aa907b5627c2186f","request_identity_sha256":"efce9562c75274ce8f0ba5a6c03088442b900aa38239b16b2647b32fe9ad57dd","role":"POL","schema_version":"no-memory-full-review-corpus-build-v2","usage":{"completion_tokens":707,"prompt_tokens":16771,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"total_tokens":17478},"valid":true}],"request_identity_sha256":"efce9562c75274ce8f0ba5a6c03088442b900aa38239b16b2647b32fe9ad57dd","role":"POL","role_ordinal":4,"schema_version":"corpus-build-bootstrap-checkpoint-v1"}